{"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOToolBarTop\/init(title:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:principalItem:trailingItems:)"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOToolBarTop\/body(content:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOToolBarTop\/ViewModifier-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The top toolbar (aka "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"navigation bar"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" on iOS and iPadOS 18 and lower) sits at the top of the screen and provides contextual information","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and controls related to the current view."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It typically displays the page title, and may include navigation actions such as “Back” or “Close” as well as supplementary actions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"It can contain leading, principal (center, single item only), and trailing actions."}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOToolBarTop"}],"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents14MISOToolBarTopV","title":"MISOToolBarTop","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOToolBarTop"}],"role":"symbol","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOToolBarTop"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOToolBarTop"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Warning","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": If an item is placed in principal position, the subtitle is never displayed (whatever ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasLargeTitle"},{"text":" is), because","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI’s "},{"code":".principal","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" placement only replaces the inline compact bar title, not ","type":"text"},{"code":".navigationSubtitle()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (iOS 26+), which would","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"otherwise keep rendering next to the item with no visible title next to it. The title itself is displayed only if ","type":"text"},{"code":"hasLargeTitle","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (in that case it appears below the bar, in large title mode, not inside it)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Appearances","anchor":"Appearances"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With Liquid Glass \/ iOS 26+ the OS will change the rendering of the toolbar items depending to the context:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The OS can group the items of same types in one group with kind of rectangle (e.g. views with menus)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"But for buttons items they will remain isolated","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The placement of the title can be leading or centered depending to the length of the text","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The text can be truncated if there is not enough remaining space"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The OS can apply another style for the back button"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Without Liquid Glass \/ iOS 18 and lower, the OS won’t change that much the style of the toolbar items, Items won’t be visually grouped.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Globaly the appearence of the * navigation bar* elements is changed by the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"misoNavigationBarAppearance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"helper of ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that must be applyed on the root view of the ","type":"text"},{"code":"NavigationStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for example.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Technical constraints","anchor":"Technical-constraints"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To be sure for iOS 18 and lower the back buttton and text have the good color, in your main view apply the following accent color:"}]},{"code":["    struct AppMainView: View {","        var body: some View {","            ContentView()","                .accentColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","        }","    }"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"text":"Platform considerations","anchor":"Platform-considerations","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The component is available on iOS, iPadOS, and visionOS","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component is not available for watchOS, tvOS and macOS"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"text":"Badges uses","anchor":"Badges-uses","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For iOS 26 with Liquid Glass, the system badge is used because the MISO badge component does not provide a suitable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rendering with the glassified effect applied on the top toolbar."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For iOS until 18 and without Liquid Glass  MISO badge component is always used."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Code sample","anchor":"Code-sample","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    ContentView()","        .toolBarTop(\"Title\",","            leadingItems: {","                MISOToolBarItem(navigation: .back())","            },","            principalItem: MISOToolBarItem(icon: Image(decorative: \"search\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Search\") { \/* Action to process *\/ },","            trailingItems: {","                MISOToolBarItem(label: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","                MISOToolBarItem(icon: Image(decorative: \"some_image\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","            }","        )"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" helper can also be used to apply a SwiftUI toolbar configuration."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    toolBarTop(_:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:principalItem:trailingItems:)"]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","i